5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,We need to know the costs before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We still have to live here together. Let's keep it simple.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Who is actually doing the work? I want to know the hours.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One house has suffered for years. We need fairness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, do you think we can just move it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
