12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Moving it might just move the problem, not solve it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I am not volunteering to be the phone answerer again.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we build something, who pays for the maintenance?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see what the other blocks did.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the ledger and the subsidy info.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the complaint log and the frontages.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I need the truck times and the supervised morning data.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the filing requirements and the station minutes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, let's see what we find.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. Let's get the facts.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
